                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{B}^\mathbb{N}
            respectively. Given an infinite sequence
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi α
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \alpha
            and a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+number"} natural number
