            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/principle+of+enough+functions"} principle of enough functions
                (The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locale"} locale
                of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/function+space"} function space
